    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      328.18,
      571.97,
      358.73
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Southeast Bay of Bengal deep sea areas and the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Hambantota via Trincomalee and Pottuvil.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      375.53,
      578.69,
      572.49
    ],
    "text": "A low-pressure area has formed over the southeastern Bay of Bengal. It is very likely to move northwestwards and intensify into a depression over the same region around 15th November 2026. Thereafter, it is likely to move north-northwestwards and intensify further into a cyclonic storm over the central Bay of Bengal around 16th November. Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 05N-15N and 80E-90E, and the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Hambanthota via Trincomalee and Pottuvil, from 5.30am on 14 November 2026 until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas. The naval and fishing communities, are requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      933.79,
      347.86,
      946.73
    ],
    "text": "The next bulletin will be issued at 05.00pm on 14 November 2026",
